/storexyn {
/n exch def
/y n array def
/x n array def
n 1 sub -1 0 {
/i exch def
y i 3 2 roll put
x i 3 2 roll put
} for
} def

/arrowhead {
0 begin
transform originalCTM itransform
/taily exch def
/tailx exch def
